tyAttachmentModifierV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"accessibility(sortPriority:)","externalID":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewPAAE13accessibility12sortPriorityAA15ModifiedContentVyxAA31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierVGSd_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:5Swami20Interaction_DragViewV","extendedModule":"SwiftUICore"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"code":"View.accessibility(sortPriority:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"nonisolated"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibility"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"sortPriority"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","text":"ModifiedContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibility(sortpriority:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibility(sortPriority:)":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibility(sortPriority:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibility","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"sortPriority","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ModifiedContent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[],"title":"accessibility(sortPriority:)","type":"topic","deprecated":true,"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibility(sortpriority:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","title":"Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}